1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:16,688
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00:16,958 --> 00:00:19,125
Don't leave me alone

3
00:00:19,208 --> 00:00:24,166
Trembling in the dark night

4
00:00:28,666 --> 00:00:31,625
SHENG 2026 CONCERT "DON'T LEAVE ME ALONE" HITS GLOBAL SUCCESS

5
00:00:31,708 --> 00:00:34,208
I'm used to having you around

6
00:00:34,291 --> 00:00:37,791
I really can't lose you

7
00:00:38,750 --> 00:00:42,666
If you still love me

8
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:48,625
Can you hold me tight again?

9
00:00:51,458 --> 00:00:52,625
Thank you all.

10
00:00:53,791 --> 00:00:56,041
You are like family to me.

11
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,458
Without you, I wouldn't be here.

12
00:01:22,833 --> 00:01:24,875
THE FIXERS

13
00:01:26,166 --> 00:01:29,541
NIGHT AND DAY

14
00:01:30,208 --> 00:01:34,625
Chao Ming-cheng dropped a bombshell at the Ming Young Party fundraiser today.

15
00:01:34,708 --> 00:01:37,375
He shared a video of his son being framed by mobsters…

16
00:02:02,333 --> 00:02:03,458
I'm so happy you came.

17
00:02:03,541 --> 00:02:04,916
Dad dislikes it when I join.

18
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:08,333
Otherwise, I'd love attending these pretentious gatherings.

19
00:02:09,833 --> 00:02:11,750
Keep your brother out of trouble.

20
00:02:11,833 --> 00:02:12,666
It'll be fine.

21
00:02:18,750 --> 00:02:21,083
Lucky, didn't I say you can't play with this one?

22
00:02:21,166 --> 00:02:22,666
Go get another one.

23
00:03:01,958 --> 00:03:03,083
Are you okay?

24
00:03:03,166 --> 00:03:04,500
Did you get hurt?

25
00:03:04,583 --> 00:03:07,333
-Have you been secretly practicing? -It's all about talent, okay?

26
00:03:10,541 --> 00:03:12,250
Two years of practice.

27
00:03:12,333 --> 00:03:14,625
Your brother beat you in just three months.

28
00:03:15,625 --> 00:03:17,208
Use your two-handed backhand more.

29
00:03:17,291 --> 00:03:18,791
You could've won sooner.

30
00:03:19,458 --> 00:03:21,583
Dragging out a win is still a loss.

31
00:03:22,083 --> 00:03:23,208
Do you hear me?

32
00:03:25,125 --> 00:03:26,291
Good job.

33
00:03:27,708 --> 00:03:28,541
Very good.

34
00:03:30,333 --> 00:03:31,166
Keep it up.

35
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:38,833
Sir.

36
00:03:39,333 --> 00:03:40,750
Oh, Tristan, come.

37
00:03:40,833 --> 00:03:41,833
Meet the speaker.

38
00:03:43,125 --> 00:03:44,583
Hello, sir.

39
00:03:44,666 --> 00:03:45,875
This is Tristan.

40
00:03:46,458 --> 00:03:48,125
Why didn't you say you were here?

41
00:03:48,208 --> 00:03:49,791
You were all busy.

42
00:03:50,291 --> 00:03:51,375
Not that busy.

43
00:04:01,791 --> 00:04:04,291
Howie, time for breakfast!

44
00:04:04,375 --> 00:04:06,458
Brooding heartthrob Sheng…

45
00:04:07,083 --> 00:04:09,833
Tell me. Where did you go last night?

46
00:04:09,916 --> 00:04:13,125
You used to flip through channels when you returned from a big score.

47
00:04:13,208 --> 00:04:14,833
Did you get into trouble?

48
00:04:15,416 --> 00:04:16,458
What trouble?

49
00:04:16,541 --> 00:04:19,041
My biggest trouble in life is you.

50
00:04:19,125 --> 00:04:20,375
Yeah, right.

51
00:04:23,375 --> 00:04:24,708
Who could it be this early?

52
00:04:29,791 --> 00:04:31,083
And you are?

53
00:04:31,666 --> 00:04:33,416
I am looking for Felix Chiang.

54
00:04:34,958 --> 00:04:35,791
Okay.

55
00:04:36,458 --> 00:04:37,625
Felix.

56
00:04:38,125 --> 00:04:39,375
-What? -It's for you.

57
00:04:43,458 --> 00:04:44,416
How can I help you?

58
00:04:44,500 --> 00:04:46,583
I am from Ching He.

59
00:04:47,083 --> 00:04:49,125
I'd like you to come by.

60
00:04:52,541 --> 00:04:54,458
I didn't donate that much last year.

61
00:04:54,541 --> 00:04:56,625
You're far too kind to honor me like this.

62
00:05:07,541 --> 00:05:10,250
Howie, eat your breakfast quickly. Don't be late for school.

63
00:05:18,708 --> 00:05:20,083
Quite the big shot, Loach.

64
00:05:20,583 --> 00:05:22,666
A cop car last time. A fancy car this time.

65
00:05:22,750 --> 00:05:25,958
Milky, I don't have time today. I'll buy us tea next time.

66
00:05:26,041 --> 00:05:26,875
Fuck your tea.

67
00:05:26,958 --> 00:05:29,500
If you don't pay today, I won't fucking let you go.

68
00:05:31,958 --> 00:05:35,916
How about you come with us to Ching He Temple for tea, Milky?

69
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,708
Who are you to interrupt my boss?

70
00:05:37,791 --> 00:05:38,708
Shut up!

71
00:05:39,208 --> 00:05:41,208
Sorry, sir. Kids don't know any better.

72
00:05:41,291 --> 00:05:42,500
I'll get the door for you.

73
00:05:44,333 --> 00:05:45,500
Please.

74
00:05:46,916 --> 00:05:48,041
Don't whine. Be good.

75
00:05:57,666 --> 00:05:58,833
Boss, who are they?

76
00:05:58,916 --> 00:06:01,916
Your boss's boss, as in my boss, once told me

77
00:06:02,416 --> 00:06:04,666
to stay far away from Ching He's men.

78
00:06:05,166 --> 00:06:07,375
Loach is getting cooked this time.

79
00:06:07,958 --> 00:06:09,250
Damn it.

80
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,000
Sir.

81
00:06:18,375 --> 00:06:19,208
Hey.

82
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:22,625
The chairman of Ching He, Thackery Huang.

83
00:06:22,708 --> 00:06:24,291
Thanks for your help last night.

84
00:06:24,375 --> 00:06:25,291
Oh, sir.

85
00:06:25,375 --> 00:06:26,375
Don't worry.

86
00:06:26,458 --> 00:06:27,791
I won't mention it.

87
00:06:27,875 --> 00:06:29,291
Nothing seals tighter than my lips.

88
00:06:31,291 --> 00:06:32,250
Remember Sir Hong?

89
00:06:32,833 --> 00:06:34,750
I can't even recall what I ate last night.

90
00:06:34,833 --> 00:06:35,875
Over a decade ago,

91
00:06:36,500 --> 00:06:40,458
San He sent you to protect Chamber Thirteen's leader, Black Bull.

92
00:06:41,333 --> 00:06:44,083
But he was killed right under your nose.

93
00:06:44,166 --> 00:06:45,916
The one who took him out

94
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,125
was me.

95
00:06:50,041 --> 00:06:50,875
Sir,

96
00:06:51,375 --> 00:06:52,916
I believe whatever you say.

97
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:55,958
But I really didn't know Black Bull. I'd never met him.

98
00:06:56,041 --> 00:06:57,125
You have the wrong guy.

99
00:06:57,208 --> 00:06:58,041
Hey.

100
00:06:58,541 --> 00:07:02,666
Back when you and Chen Liang-chi used to fight for turf for San He,

101
00:07:03,458 --> 00:07:05,750
nobody could rival you two.

102
00:07:05,833 --> 00:07:07,000
You, in particular,

103
00:07:07,583 --> 00:07:08,791
never killed anyone.

104
00:07:11,708 --> 00:07:13,833
You only injured your opponents' kneecaps.

105
00:07:16,958 --> 00:07:17,791
Sir,

106
00:07:18,291 --> 00:07:20,291
I was just trying to make a living.

107
00:07:21,208 --> 00:07:22,958
Over a decade has passed.

108
00:07:23,458 --> 00:07:25,541
Your aim is as sharp as ever.

109
00:07:25,625 --> 00:07:27,500
Is there a chance

110
00:07:27,583 --> 00:07:30,000
that you'd work for us at Ching He?

111
00:07:30,083 --> 00:07:31,166
Oh, no.

112
00:07:31,666 --> 00:07:33,000
I'm no longer the same.

113
00:07:33,083 --> 00:07:34,333
Besides, my hand…

114
00:07:35,375 --> 00:07:37,666
Anyway, I really can't work for you.

115
00:07:38,166 --> 00:07:41,708
From what I know, you've been in need of help lately.

116
00:07:42,416 --> 00:07:44,416
If you come and work for us,

117
00:07:44,958 --> 00:07:46,500
money is no object.

118
00:07:53,750 --> 00:07:55,625
I don't think that's necessary.

119
00:07:55,708 --> 00:07:57,541
I only want my family to be safe.

120
00:07:57,625 --> 00:08:00,833
And please, don't come to my place again.

121
00:08:00,916 --> 00:08:02,625
Like ships that pass in the night,

122
00:08:02,708 --> 00:08:04,500
let's stay out of each other's sight.

123
00:08:04,583 --> 00:08:06,958
Goodbye.

124
00:08:13,166 --> 00:08:14,166
So,

125
00:08:14,666 --> 00:08:17,333
should we look for someone else?

126
00:08:17,833 --> 00:08:19,541
Give him some time.

127
00:08:20,041 --> 00:08:22,166
He will come back.

128
00:08:34,833 --> 00:08:35,833
Lucky.

129
00:08:38,833 --> 00:08:40,041
Wait.

130
00:08:40,125 --> 00:08:40,958
Okay.

131
00:08:42,666 --> 00:08:43,875
No more.

132
00:08:43,958 --> 00:08:45,333
The vet said you're on a diet.

133
00:08:47,625 --> 00:08:48,750
Last one.

134
00:08:59,083 --> 00:09:04,416
Superstar Sheng released his latest album, Fantastic Beast…

135
00:09:05,208 --> 00:09:07,041
SHENG ANNOUNCES TAIPEI ARENA CONCERT

136
00:09:20,166 --> 00:09:21,583
Lucky, sit.

137
00:09:23,125 --> 00:09:24,250
Wait for me at home.

138
00:09:24,333 --> 00:09:25,291
See you tonight.

139
00:09:30,833 --> 00:09:31,791
Welcome.

140
00:09:31,875 --> 00:09:34,041
Our bread is fresh out of the oven.

141
00:09:34,125 --> 00:09:35,958
Sir, I'll have a three-in-one combo.

142
00:09:36,958 --> 00:09:40,625
Pineapple, scallion, pork floss. One of each! Make them hot!

143
00:09:42,875 --> 00:09:43,708
Feeling better?

144
00:09:44,208 --> 00:09:45,416
I'm fine now.

145
00:09:45,500 --> 00:09:47,875
It's nothing compared to before.

146
00:09:48,458 --> 00:09:49,416
Fucking tough.

147
00:09:53,375 --> 00:09:54,791
Your wife didn't ask anything?

148
00:09:57,041 --> 00:09:59,375
Saw a hottie while riding my motorbike, and I crashed.

149
00:10:00,375 --> 00:10:01,791
-She believed that? -Yeah.

150
00:10:02,958 --> 00:10:03,791
Here.

151
00:10:05,583 --> 00:10:06,416
Here.

152
00:10:07,458 --> 00:10:09,208
I'm heading to school.

153
00:10:10,125 --> 00:10:12,666
Hurry home after school.

154
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,416
Hello, sir.

155
00:10:17,541 --> 00:10:18,708
It's bro.

156
00:10:18,791 --> 00:10:20,291
Hello, bro.

157
00:10:21,791 --> 00:10:22,666
What?

158
00:10:25,666 --> 00:10:26,958
We need more salad dressing.

159
00:10:27,041 --> 00:10:27,958
Oh, okay.

160
00:10:33,125 --> 00:10:35,166
-What's this? -It's for your son.

161
00:10:35,666 --> 00:10:37,791
Why didn't you give it to him just now?

162
00:10:40,791 --> 00:10:42,583
It hits different coming from his dad.

163
00:10:46,875 --> 00:10:48,500
Did they say who will replace me?

164
00:10:48,583 --> 00:10:49,833
There's no one else.

165
00:10:49,916 --> 00:10:51,875
They'll let me go solo for sure this time.

166
00:10:53,291 --> 00:10:55,125
You know the chairman.

167
00:10:55,875 --> 00:10:58,500
He'd never agree to anything against the rules.

168
00:10:58,583 --> 00:11:01,125
CHING HE TEMPLE: EIGHT O'CLOCK TONIGHT

169
00:11:03,125 --> 00:11:04,750
Chen Chia-yun.

170
00:11:05,583 --> 00:11:06,958
Time to eat.

171
00:11:13,625 --> 00:11:15,000
Chen Chia-yun.

172
00:11:33,208 --> 00:11:34,625
Don't you get sick of this?

173
00:11:35,125 --> 00:11:36,375
You startled me.

174
00:11:37,083 --> 00:11:38,125
What happened to you?

175
00:11:38,625 --> 00:11:39,916
Got into a fight?

176
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:41,291
-It's a dog bite. -Dog bite?

177
00:11:41,375 --> 00:11:42,208
Hey.

178
00:11:42,708 --> 00:11:44,375
Your 70-to-30 golden ratio.

179
00:11:46,208 --> 00:11:48,500
My ticket!

180
00:11:49,416 --> 00:11:51,250
You got Sheng's face dirty.

181
00:11:51,333 --> 00:11:52,833
It's all wet now.

182
00:11:59,500 --> 00:12:01,583
What ticket? You're so uptight about it.

183
00:12:01,666 --> 00:12:04,000
A concert ticket. It took me forever to get one.

184
00:12:04,083 --> 00:12:05,000
Going with a guy?

185
00:12:05,083 --> 00:12:06,000
No.

186
00:12:06,500 --> 00:12:08,458
-You've got a boyfriend. -No.

187
00:12:08,541 --> 00:12:10,208
"No."

188
00:12:10,291 --> 00:12:12,458
This was in the mail. It's in English.

189
00:12:17,041 --> 00:12:18,708
What is it?

190
00:12:19,583 --> 00:12:22,250
An acceptance letter from the US exam board!

191
00:12:22,333 --> 00:12:23,333
Seriously?

192
00:12:23,416 --> 00:12:25,958
Hickory, dickory, dock. She's a chip off the old block!

193
00:12:26,041 --> 00:12:27,125
You're in luck, buddy.

194
00:12:27,208 --> 00:12:30,166
But I was just giving it a try. I don't have to go.

195
00:12:30,250 --> 00:12:33,375
Don't worry about money. I will take care of it, okay?

196
00:12:33,458 --> 00:12:36,125
This can wait until I graduate and save up.

197
00:12:36,958 --> 00:12:38,625
Your dad and I never achieved much.

198
00:12:38,708 --> 00:12:40,416
Luckily, you're smart like your mom.

199
00:12:40,500 --> 00:12:41,958
Don't miss your chance.

200
00:12:42,041 --> 00:12:44,750
I will figure out the money, all right?

201
00:12:47,625 --> 00:12:48,458
Hello?

202
00:12:48,541 --> 00:12:52,458
Hello, this is Hsing Tai Bank. Is this Mr. Chiang?

203
00:12:52,541 --> 00:12:53,541
Yes, it is.

204
00:12:53,625 --> 00:12:57,416
This is a courtesy reminder to make your loan payment for this month.

205
00:12:57,500 --> 00:12:59,500
-It is overdue. -Go eat.

206
00:12:59,583 --> 00:13:03,500
Please remit payment to prevent a negative impact on your credit score.

207
00:13:05,291 --> 00:13:07,166
Okay, I understand.

208
00:13:07,250 --> 00:13:08,500
Thank you.

209
00:13:23,750 --> 00:13:25,333
Parkinson's disease?

210
00:13:27,958 --> 00:13:29,625
How's that possible, Doctor?

211
00:13:30,125 --> 00:13:32,958
I've never had any major illnesses.

212
00:13:33,041 --> 00:13:35,375
I've only sprained my right hand.

213
00:13:35,458 --> 00:13:37,958
Your situation is quite rare.

214
00:13:38,041 --> 00:13:43,041
Besides resting hand tremors, you also have concurrent action tremors.

215
00:13:43,125 --> 00:13:45,291
Then how is this disease treated?

216
00:13:45,791 --> 00:13:47,833
Will my left hand also become like this?

217
00:13:47,916 --> 00:13:51,958
This disease is caused by the degeneration of substantia nigra cells in the brain.

218
00:13:52,041 --> 00:13:55,083
-Dopamine secretion… -Doctor, make it simple.

219
00:13:55,166 --> 00:13:58,208
Simply put, it is usually incurable.

220
00:13:58,291 --> 00:14:02,625
But active treatment with medication can slow down its progression.

221
00:14:05,875 --> 00:14:06,791
Then…

222
00:14:06,875 --> 00:14:08,333
Then, when it progresses,

223
00:14:08,875 --> 00:14:10,708
what happens?

224
00:14:11,208 --> 00:14:16,458
Some patients may develop disabilities or dementia in the final stages.

225
00:14:16,541 --> 00:14:18,583
But the rate of progression varies.

226
00:14:18,666 --> 00:14:22,083
Some progress from the initial to the final stage in just three months.

227
00:14:22,166 --> 00:14:26,166
But if managed well, it could take ten years or more.

228
00:14:29,333 --> 00:14:30,458
Sweetie,

229
00:14:31,208 --> 00:14:32,666
when Howie's exams are done,

230
00:14:33,166 --> 00:14:34,291
let's travel abroad.

231
00:14:35,291 --> 00:14:37,333
I've never even taken you guys abroad.

232
00:14:47,875 --> 00:14:51,083
The chairman says you can go in and see him now.

233
00:14:51,166 --> 00:14:52,000
Okay.

234
00:15:11,541 --> 00:15:13,916
Let me say this first. I won't do anything immoral.

235
00:15:14,625 --> 00:15:15,708
Don't worry.

236
00:15:16,583 --> 00:15:18,833
We are not killers or criminals.

237
00:15:19,541 --> 00:15:22,250
We merely help people take care of problems.

238
00:15:23,666 --> 00:15:27,125
This type of fish is called a janitor fish.

239
00:15:27,708 --> 00:15:30,708
They usually hide in the murkiest waters.

240
00:15:31,375 --> 00:15:32,583
No natural predators.

241
00:15:32,666 --> 00:15:34,625
Extremely resilient.

242
00:15:35,458 --> 00:15:38,125
But humans don't like them.

243
00:15:38,625 --> 00:15:41,500
They find them dirty and smelly.

244
00:15:42,333 --> 00:15:44,791
But without them,

245
00:15:44,875 --> 00:15:47,041
the water would have long been polluted.

246
00:15:47,541 --> 00:15:48,916
Ching He's fixers

247
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:50,750
are like this type of fish.

248
00:15:51,333 --> 00:15:53,041
Whether it's high society

249
00:15:53,750 --> 00:15:55,458
or the criminal underworld,

250
00:15:56,083 --> 00:15:59,416
when someone runs into a problem they shouldn't handle themselves,

251
00:15:59,916 --> 00:16:01,208
they hire us

252
00:16:01,708 --> 00:16:05,666
to secretly clean it up for them.

253
00:16:08,208 --> 00:16:10,833
We are above both sides of the law.

254
00:16:11,333 --> 00:16:12,958
We don't favor either side.

255
00:16:13,458 --> 00:16:15,833
Here, you don't go by your name.

256
00:16:16,375 --> 00:16:17,750
Only a code name.

257
00:16:17,833 --> 00:16:19,541
Oh. That's easy.

258
00:16:20,041 --> 00:16:21,916
Others call me Swamp Eel.

259
00:16:28,833 --> 00:16:31,083
CHING HE

260
00:16:34,750 --> 00:16:38,458
Fixer code names come from the Thousand Character Classic.

261
00:16:38,958 --> 00:16:39,875
Then what's mine?

262
00:16:43,541 --> 00:16:44,500
Why is he here?

263
00:16:45,083 --> 00:16:46,416
You again, jerk?

264
00:16:46,500 --> 00:16:49,291
Listen, we still have a score to settle.

265
00:16:49,375 --> 00:16:50,208
He's Fixer Gold.

266
00:16:50,708 --> 00:16:53,500
-He'll be your partner from now on. -Why?

267
00:16:53,583 --> 00:16:54,750
No way.

268
00:16:55,833 --> 00:16:58,875
Only Fixer Shadow can tolerate your temper.

269
00:16:59,375 --> 00:17:01,750
No other fixer wants to team up with you.

270
00:17:03,208 --> 00:17:05,708
His kneecap is now injured.

271
00:17:05,791 --> 00:17:08,666
It will take him at least half a year to recover.

272
00:17:08,750 --> 00:17:10,208
I can handle jobs on my own.

273
00:17:10,291 --> 00:17:11,708
I don't need a partner,

274
00:17:11,791 --> 00:17:13,208
especially not dead weight.

275
00:17:13,291 --> 00:17:15,250
Damn, are you looking down on me?

276
00:17:15,333 --> 00:17:17,083
Fixers work in pairs.

277
00:17:17,166 --> 00:17:18,416
That is the rule.

278
00:17:18,916 --> 00:17:20,458
And I've decided.

279
00:17:20,541 --> 00:17:22,041
Until Fixer Shadow returns,

280
00:17:22,541 --> 00:17:24,208
you two will be partners.

281
00:17:31,125 --> 00:17:33,208
CHING HE

282
00:17:40,958 --> 00:17:44,125
Ching He has three rules.

283
00:17:44,208 --> 00:17:46,625
Fixers must abide by them.

284
00:17:46,708 --> 00:17:47,583
Sir Hong.

285
00:17:47,666 --> 00:17:48,583
First,

286
00:17:49,166 --> 00:17:51,583
in life or death,

287
00:17:52,083 --> 00:17:56,833
fixers must not reveal any of Ching He's secrets.

288
00:17:56,916 --> 00:17:59,958
Second, fixers must not disobey orders.

289
00:18:00,041 --> 00:18:02,375
When on a mission,

290
00:18:02,458 --> 00:18:04,833
unless recalled by Ching He,

291
00:18:04,916 --> 00:18:07,000
fixers must not abandon their duties.

292
00:18:07,583 --> 00:18:10,916
Third, fixers must not reveal their identity

293
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:15,208
or alter missions due to personal feelings.

294
00:18:15,291 --> 00:18:16,375
So…

295
00:18:16,875 --> 00:18:20,208
What happens if a fixer breaks the rules?

296
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:24,041
One word.

297
00:18:24,125 --> 00:18:25,083
Death.

298
00:18:27,083 --> 00:18:28,541
Get lost if you're afraid.

299
00:18:28,625 --> 00:18:29,750
Who's afraid?

300
00:18:29,833 --> 00:18:32,708
We play by the rules. Don't you know that?

301
00:18:33,875 --> 00:18:38,791
The request this time is to erase her daughter's sex tape.

302
00:18:39,416 --> 00:18:40,500
Who is the client?

303
00:18:41,666 --> 00:18:43,250
A district prosecutor.

304
00:18:43,333 --> 00:18:44,416
Yen Wen-chieh.

305
00:18:44,958 --> 00:18:49,500
Ms. Yen's daughter filmed a sex video with the singer, Sheng,

306
00:18:50,125 --> 00:18:51,625
while they were dating.

307
00:18:52,125 --> 00:18:53,666
Now that they've broken up,

308
00:18:54,166 --> 00:18:57,166
Ms. Yen is worried that the video may leak,

309
00:18:57,250 --> 00:19:00,916
so she's hired Ching He to get rid of it.

310
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:03,458
You'll use this to communicate.

311
00:19:03,541 --> 00:19:06,166
By the way, you haven't told me my code name.

312
00:19:06,250 --> 00:19:07,333
Fixer Bottom.

313
00:19:09,166 --> 00:19:12,500
I'll tell you after the mission.

314
00:19:18,416 --> 00:19:19,833
Is this your car too?

315
00:19:20,333 --> 00:19:21,958
Is being a fixer that lucrative?

316
00:19:22,041 --> 00:19:23,875
You drive a different car every day.

317
00:19:28,208 --> 00:19:30,041
Hey, I'm your partner now.

318
00:19:30,125 --> 00:19:31,666
Don't think about ditching me.

319
00:19:36,375 --> 00:19:40,666
Find a way to put this on Sheng, then try to take his phone.

320
00:19:40,750 --> 00:19:41,750
And then?

321
00:19:42,500 --> 00:19:43,625
I'll tell you later.

322
00:19:44,125 --> 00:19:45,666
Okay, come on, let's go.

323
00:19:52,708 --> 00:19:55,041
Fuck you.

324
00:19:55,541 --> 00:19:57,250
Disloyal son of a bitch.

325
00:19:57,750 --> 00:19:58,916
Damn it.

326
00:20:02,666 --> 00:20:04,916
Trackers nowadays are so small.

327
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:06,666
It looks just like a button cell.

328
00:20:08,625 --> 00:20:10,750
How do I get close to that Sheng guy?

329
00:20:19,166 --> 00:20:21,583
BOOHOO, MY TICKET GOT DIRTY

330
00:20:28,625 --> 00:20:29,916
SHENG

331
00:20:42,250 --> 00:20:44,166
CHIA-YUN

332
00:20:53,166 --> 00:20:55,708
Excuse me. Is the backstage area this way?

333
00:20:55,791 --> 00:20:57,666
-Are you on staff? -No.

334
00:20:57,750 --> 00:20:59,625
Only staff are allowed backstage.

335
00:20:59,708 --> 00:21:00,541
Really?

336
00:21:03,208 --> 00:21:05,166
The show has started. Please hurry.

337
00:21:14,208 --> 00:21:16,541
Our entryway is designed to attract wealth.

338
00:21:16,625 --> 00:21:17,875
As for fortune, we hired…

339
00:21:17,958 --> 00:21:20,333
Can you cut the crap? Answer only when asked.

340
00:21:20,416 --> 00:21:22,750
-Which way is up? -This way, please.

341
00:21:23,250 --> 00:21:24,250
I'll call the elevator.

342
00:21:25,416 --> 00:21:27,083
Who lives in this building?

343
00:21:27,166 --> 00:21:29,791
Prominent figures like you. Just not as handsome.

344
00:21:29,875 --> 00:21:31,958
Who lives above and below? Are they noisy?

345
00:21:32,041 --> 00:21:35,958
Soundproofing is great here, but I can't disclose who they are.

346
00:21:36,750 --> 00:21:39,125
I want to get a feel for the vibe in the living room.

347
00:21:39,208 --> 00:21:40,333
Wait for me in there.

348
00:21:40,416 --> 00:21:42,000
Don't come out until I call you.

349
00:21:42,083 --> 00:21:43,833
I… Me?

350
00:21:43,916 --> 00:21:45,916
-Yes. -Oh, okay, then…

351
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:46,875
Then…

352
00:21:47,375 --> 00:21:48,958
Tell me if you need anything.

353
00:22:08,125 --> 00:22:09,666
-Thank you. -Excuse me.

354
00:22:09,750 --> 00:22:10,916
Thank you.

355
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:12,041
Watch out.

356
00:22:15,333 --> 00:22:16,250
Hey.

357
00:22:40,750 --> 00:22:42,666
Fixer Stealth, set up a proxy.

358
00:22:42,750 --> 00:22:44,500
I'm busy. Working late, coding.

359
00:22:44,583 --> 00:22:47,375
Cut the crap. I hacked his laptop with your program.

360
00:22:47,458 --> 00:22:48,791
Not a damn thing in it.

361
00:22:49,541 --> 00:22:51,916
I suspect he stores all the videos on his phone.

362
00:22:52,416 --> 00:22:54,333
Can you hack into his phone?

363
00:22:54,833 --> 00:22:56,541
The Trojan is in there, so…

364
00:22:57,333 --> 00:23:00,583
You need to get his phone if you want to delete the videos from it.

365
00:23:00,666 --> 00:23:04,041
First, send the surveillance footage from his mobile messaging app to me.

366
00:23:08,750 --> 00:23:11,125
Sorry.

367
00:23:11,208 --> 00:23:13,791
SHENG, ARTIST'S DRESSING ROOM

368
00:23:17,375 --> 00:23:20,083
I'm here to fix the air conditioner.

369
00:23:20,625 --> 00:23:21,666
Thank you.

370
00:23:26,750 --> 00:23:28,541
You are like family to me.

371
00:23:30,916 --> 00:23:32,166
Thank you all.

372
00:23:33,541 --> 00:23:35,916
I will definitely come back.

373
00:23:40,291 --> 00:23:42,625
I know he shouldn't turn it down,

374
00:23:42,708 --> 00:23:45,750
but he must rest for at least a week after today's performance.

375
00:23:45,833 --> 00:23:47,083
That's what the doctor said.

376
00:23:47,791 --> 00:23:51,000
Listen, we need to think long-term.

377
00:23:51,083 --> 00:23:52,083
Okay?

378
00:23:54,666 --> 00:23:55,875
He's here. I'll call you.

379
00:23:55,958 --> 00:23:57,625
That's all for now. Bye.

380
00:23:59,000 --> 00:24:00,041
Are you okay?

381
00:24:05,291 --> 00:24:06,500
Where are the fans?

382
00:24:07,000 --> 00:24:09,625
At the exit passageway. I have someone keeping watch.

383
00:24:15,541 --> 00:24:18,125
Sorry, we need to clear the room. Thanks.

384
00:24:19,125 --> 00:24:20,458
Thank you. Sir.

385
00:24:21,250 --> 00:24:22,916
We need to clear the room.

386
00:24:23,000 --> 00:24:24,541
Okay, right away.

387
00:24:29,458 --> 00:24:30,791
-Sorry. -Not at all.

388
00:24:30,875 --> 00:24:32,125
Thank you.

389
00:25:08,625 --> 00:25:09,833
So many people.

390
00:25:21,708 --> 00:25:23,166
Add me.

391
00:25:32,500 --> 00:25:34,833
Sheng, can you give me an autograph?

392
00:25:34,916 --> 00:25:35,750
Right here.

393
00:25:41,000 --> 00:25:42,625
Can you write "To Chia-yun"?

394
00:25:44,083 --> 00:25:44,916
So handsome!

395
00:25:45,000 --> 00:25:47,541
Excuse me. Give me an autograph.

396
00:25:47,625 --> 00:25:49,125
Put it on my chest.

397
00:25:49,208 --> 00:25:52,125
-Stay away, please. -I really like him. I have all his albums.

398
00:25:52,208 --> 00:25:53,458
I really like you.

399
00:25:53,541 --> 00:25:54,375
Thanks, folks.

400
00:25:54,458 --> 00:25:56,250
Can I get an autograph, please?

401
00:25:56,333 --> 00:25:58,583
-Thanks, folks. That's all for now. -Oh, come on.

402
00:25:58,666 --> 00:25:59,833
Bye.

403
00:26:02,500 --> 00:26:04,250
Let's catch him at the exit!

404
00:26:11,791 --> 00:26:12,708
Felix Chiang!

405
00:26:13,291 --> 00:26:14,708
Why are you here?

406
00:26:16,916 --> 00:26:19,125
-You stole my ticket, didn't you? -No, listen.

407
00:26:19,208 --> 00:26:21,166
You ruined it. I had to buy from a scalper!

408
00:26:21,250 --> 00:26:22,875
Do you know how expensive it was?

409
00:26:22,958 --> 00:26:23,875
Let me explain.

410
00:26:23,958 --> 00:26:25,916
Since when are you a Sheng fan?

411
00:26:26,500 --> 00:26:27,625
No.

412
00:26:28,208 --> 00:26:30,375
Howie had midterms and couldn't come.

413
00:26:30,458 --> 00:26:32,291
He asked me to get an autograph for him.

414
00:26:32,375 --> 00:26:34,250
-Howie Chiang? -Yeah. His idol.

415
00:26:34,958 --> 00:26:35,791
Hey, tell me.

416
00:26:37,083 --> 00:26:39,041
What did he just whisper to you?

417
00:26:39,125 --> 00:26:40,041
Just now?

418
00:26:40,541 --> 00:26:42,166
-The album! -Hey!

419
00:26:42,250 --> 00:26:44,333
That Sheng isn't a nice guy!

420
00:26:53,125 --> 00:26:55,000
Don't forget your interview later.

421
00:26:55,666 --> 00:26:56,708
I'm not going.

422
00:26:57,291 --> 00:26:58,500
Get a hotel room for me.

423
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:02,166
But we've agreed to it. Last time--

424
00:27:03,583 --> 00:27:04,708
I said I'm not going.

425
00:27:07,666 --> 00:27:08,541
Close the door.

426
00:27:18,041 --> 00:27:18,875
NANA

427
00:27:18,958 --> 00:27:21,166
HI, IT'S SHENG. THANKS FOR COMING. FREE LATER?

428
00:27:22,583 --> 00:27:23,583
GOT A NEW DROP TODAY

429
00:27:23,666 --> 00:27:26,708
MUST BE NICE TO BE HANDSOME! WHAT KIND OF FAN IS IT?

430
00:27:26,791 --> 00:27:30,000
FUCK! THE OBSESSIVE TYPE. SUPER FORWARD

431
00:27:31,583 --> 00:27:33,250
WHERE ARE YOU UNWRAPPING IT?

432
00:27:36,166 --> 00:27:37,000
THEY GOT MIRRORS

433
00:27:37,083 --> 00:27:38,625
DON'T END UP IN THE NEWS LIKE DONG

434
00:27:38,708 --> 00:27:41,333
FUCK, THANKS FOR CLEANING UP MY MESS, TAI!

435
00:27:41,416 --> 00:27:44,500
BRING HER OVER FOR A FEW DRINKS NEXT TIME AFTER YOU'VE HAD YOUR FUN!

436
00:27:44,583 --> 00:27:46,541
Hello, this is X Hotel. How can I help you?

437
00:27:46,625 --> 00:27:49,000
Reserve a room on the top floor for me tonight.

438
00:27:49,083 --> 00:27:51,000
Tell Mr. Yao that it's for Louis.

439
00:27:51,500 --> 00:27:53,208
Sorry, we're fully booked today--

440
00:27:53,291 --> 00:27:55,541
Tell Mr. Yao that it's for Mr. Hsueh's son.

441
00:27:55,625 --> 00:27:57,583
-Got it? -Okay.

442
00:27:57,666 --> 00:27:58,750
I have another call.

443
00:27:58,833 --> 00:28:00,791
Send me a message when it's done.

444
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:03,833
Hello. Mission accomplished.

445
00:28:03,916 --> 00:28:05,041
What's next?

446
00:28:05,666 --> 00:28:07,583
You planted it on him?

447
00:28:07,666 --> 00:28:10,416
What do you think? Easy-peasy.

448
00:28:11,083 --> 00:28:12,625
Well, congratulations.

449
00:28:12,708 --> 00:28:13,916
You can go home.

450
00:28:14,750 --> 00:28:18,250
I worked hard to put the tracker on him. Don't you want me to follow him?

451
00:28:18,333 --> 00:28:20,250
Who told you that was a tracker?

452
00:28:20,791 --> 00:28:22,000
What was it, then?

453
00:28:24,833 --> 00:28:26,458
A regular button cell.

454
00:28:27,333 --> 00:28:28,916
A button cell?

455
00:28:29,000 --> 00:28:30,958
Why did we need to put that on him?

456
00:28:31,041 --> 00:28:32,083
Ask yourself.

457
00:28:32,583 --> 00:28:33,583
You put it.

458
00:28:34,625 --> 00:28:37,000
Damn it. I show you respect, and you piss me off.

459
00:28:37,083 --> 00:28:38,750
Hey, where are you right now?

460
00:28:39,666 --> 00:28:40,708
Hello?

461
00:28:41,750 --> 00:28:42,666
Fuck.

462
00:28:49,375 --> 00:28:50,708
Hey, hello? Chia-yun?

463
00:28:50,791 --> 00:28:52,000
How dare you call me!

464
00:28:52,500 --> 00:28:53,833
I have a question for you.

465
00:28:53,916 --> 00:28:55,708
That Sheng guy.

466
00:28:55,791 --> 00:28:57,166
Where is he going next?

467
00:28:57,250 --> 00:28:58,583
Why do you ask?

468
00:28:59,083 --> 00:29:02,208
Tell me first. I'll explain later. It's urgent.

469
00:29:02,708 --> 00:29:04,250
He's going to X Hotel.

470
00:29:04,333 --> 00:29:06,250
You're not a stan, are you?

471
00:29:06,916 --> 00:29:10,000
How do you know he's going to a hotel? Did he tell you that?

472
00:29:10,083 --> 00:29:12,000
Are you over there too?

473
00:29:12,083 --> 00:29:13,458
I'm already home.

474
00:29:13,541 --> 00:29:16,166
His stans track his every move.

475
00:29:16,250 --> 00:29:17,625
But I'm not a stan.

476
00:29:17,708 --> 00:29:20,083
What language are you speaking?

477
00:29:20,166 --> 00:29:22,250
So you're not a fan. Whatever.

478
00:29:22,833 --> 00:29:24,166
Uh, hello?

479
00:29:40,208 --> 00:29:42,125
LET'S MEET AT X HOTEL, 3105

480
00:29:45,291 --> 00:29:48,208
Mr. Yao, I want French cheese and sparkling water.

481
00:29:48,291 --> 00:29:49,875
Two of each. Send them to my room.

482
00:29:49,958 --> 00:29:51,541
Sure, I'll send them up right away.

483
00:30:37,791 --> 00:30:40,375
Sorry for making you meet me here.

484
00:30:40,875 --> 00:30:42,333
There are paparazzi at my place.

485
00:30:42,916 --> 00:30:44,541
Getting snapped by the paparazzi

486
00:30:45,208 --> 00:30:46,625
is quite exciting too.

487
00:30:52,875 --> 00:30:54,333
Do you like to be photographed?

488
00:31:03,208 --> 00:31:05,208
Roses are red, violets are blue

489
00:31:05,291 --> 00:31:06,750
I'll take you down a peg or two

490
00:31:07,250 --> 00:31:08,166
Found you.

491
00:31:11,458 --> 00:31:13,791
Fuck. What a piece of cake.

492
00:31:15,708 --> 00:31:17,541
Take this to the room across the hall.

493
00:31:17,625 --> 00:31:19,875
-Just say it's from Mr. Yao. -Okay.

494
00:31:28,583 --> 00:31:29,416
I didn't order this.

495
00:31:29,500 --> 00:31:31,708
This is compliments of the hotel manager.

496
00:31:45,458 --> 00:31:46,375
Hello, Stealth?

497
00:31:46,458 --> 00:31:50,791
Get me information on everyone in Sheng's video-sharing group

498
00:31:51,291 --> 00:31:52,625
as well as their backgrounds.

499
00:31:53,125 --> 00:31:55,291
Just so you know, I'm heading out after this.

500
00:31:55,375 --> 00:31:57,666
I keep working late, leaving my wife with the baby.

501
00:31:57,750 --> 00:32:00,541
The sterilizer broke down. Guess how many bottles I washed?

502
00:32:06,458 --> 00:32:07,833
What a unique necklace.

503
00:32:17,416 --> 00:32:19,125
Don't you think…

504
00:32:21,875 --> 00:32:23,625
doing it in front of the window

505
00:32:24,208 --> 00:32:25,500
is more exciting?

506
00:32:48,875 --> 00:32:49,833
Then…

507
00:32:52,166 --> 00:32:53,375
have you ever tried…

508
00:32:55,000 --> 00:32:56,500
filming while doing it?

509
00:32:57,000 --> 00:32:58,333
That's even more exciting.

510
00:33:33,833 --> 00:33:34,916
What a coincidence.

511
00:33:35,416 --> 00:33:36,583
Same elevator again.

512
00:33:38,666 --> 00:33:39,916
Who sent you here?

513
00:33:42,416 --> 00:33:43,333
Give me the phone.

514
00:33:47,333 --> 00:33:48,708
Going for the Taser?

515
00:34:30,833 --> 00:34:31,833
Take it!

516
00:34:32,625 --> 00:34:33,875
-Run now! -Run!

517
00:35:12,666 --> 00:35:13,750
Hand over the phone.

518
00:35:31,125 --> 00:35:33,000
If you want the phone, just say so.

519
00:35:33,083 --> 00:35:35,416
Why shoot my tires? I just changed them, you know?

520
00:36:02,083 --> 00:36:04,291
She wanted to destroy the phone too.

521
00:36:04,375 --> 00:36:05,541
Seems we shared a goal.

522
00:36:06,125 --> 00:36:08,625
I will relay this to the chairman.

523
00:36:09,125 --> 00:36:12,041
Do you think she is from Yeh Yueh Tong?

524
00:36:12,125 --> 00:36:13,083
It's possible.

525
00:36:13,666 --> 00:36:15,708
But her style isn't quite like theirs.

526
00:36:15,791 --> 00:36:17,041
She's not as ruthless.

527
00:36:17,125 --> 00:36:18,000
Got it.

528
00:36:18,083 --> 00:36:20,583
Take the phone to Ms. Yen first.

529
00:36:21,083 --> 00:36:22,166
Felix Chiang,

530
00:36:22,250 --> 00:36:24,916
you were quite clever for your first mission.

531
00:36:25,000 --> 00:36:27,916
Hey. Speaking of this, I'm pissed.

532
00:36:28,000 --> 00:36:31,416
This jerk tricked me with a button cell. Said it was a tracker.

533
00:36:31,500 --> 00:36:33,916
Fortunately, I was two steps ahead.

534
00:36:34,000 --> 00:36:36,041
I swapped his phone with mine.

535
00:36:37,625 --> 00:36:40,083
I wanted to see what you were capable of, old man.

536
00:36:40,166 --> 00:36:42,500
Wait, I now need to buy a new phone.

537
00:36:42,583 --> 00:36:43,625
Can I get reimbursed?

538
00:36:43,708 --> 00:36:44,791
Sure.

539
00:36:44,875 --> 00:36:46,958
It seems like you two are getting along.

540
00:36:47,041 --> 00:36:48,458
That's all for now. Go.

541
00:36:48,541 --> 00:36:51,000
What made you think we're getting along?

542
00:36:51,083 --> 00:36:52,083
This jerk…

543
00:36:53,750 --> 00:36:56,333
I have to buy two new tires before I've even made a cent.

544
00:36:56,416 --> 00:36:57,666
I'm paying to work here.

545
00:36:57,750 --> 00:37:00,041
Listen, you're paying for the tires.

546
00:37:01,166 --> 00:37:02,333
Goddamn it.

547
00:37:04,041 --> 00:37:06,750
Ms. Yen, I have a child too.

548
00:37:06,833 --> 00:37:08,458
I understand how you feel.

549
00:37:19,333 --> 00:37:23,416
Hey, you mentioned Yeh Yueh Tong. Who are they?

550
00:37:24,083 --> 00:37:25,625
You wouldn't understand.

551
00:37:25,708 --> 00:37:27,458
Are you gonna tell me or not?

552
00:37:30,958 --> 00:37:34,000
Their founder was kicked out of Ching He.

553
00:37:34,083 --> 00:37:36,125
She started her own organization afterward

554
00:37:36,208 --> 00:37:38,083
and stole a lot of Ching He's business.

555
00:37:45,541 --> 00:37:47,416
I can't watch it anymore.

556
00:37:48,666 --> 00:37:50,625
These aren't only videos of your daughter.

557
00:37:50,708 --> 00:37:53,833
Delete all the videos, and no one can hurt them again.

558
00:37:53,916 --> 00:37:55,750
It's confirmed. There are no other copies.

559
00:37:55,833 --> 00:37:57,250
The files can't be restored.

560
00:37:57,333 --> 00:37:58,375
Delete them all.

561
00:38:10,166 --> 00:38:12,666
If this happened to my child,

562
00:38:13,958 --> 00:38:15,500
I don't know what I would do.

563
00:38:16,833 --> 00:38:18,875
Fixers aren't psychologists.

564
00:38:20,291 --> 00:38:23,041
Save your excessive empathy for something else.

565
00:38:23,125 --> 00:38:25,833
Damn it. You heartless bastard.

566
00:38:26,958 --> 00:38:29,375
You didn't see that Sheng guy with your own eyes.

567
00:38:29,458 --> 00:38:31,791
I'm pretty sure he does snow.

568
00:38:42,333 --> 00:38:43,333
CHIA-YUN

569
00:38:44,625 --> 00:38:46,750
Chen Chia-yun is gonna chew me out.

570
00:38:58,416 --> 00:39:00,625
Hey, how did this happen?

571
00:39:01,291 --> 00:39:02,916
Weren't all the videos deleted?

572
00:39:03,000 --> 00:39:04,541
It's not Ms. Yen's daughter.

573
00:39:04,625 --> 00:39:06,041
It's another victim.

574
00:39:08,416 --> 00:39:10,625
You are like family to me.

575
00:39:12,125 --> 00:39:14,583
Without you, I wouldn't be here.

576
00:39:14,666 --> 00:39:16,041
DISGUSTING. DROP HIM.

577
00:39:16,125 --> 00:39:17,375
SURELY SHE LURED HIM

578
00:39:17,458 --> 00:39:20,166
I will definitely come back.

579
00:39:23,625 --> 00:39:26,708
SHENG'S EXPLICIT VIDEO GOES VIRAL TATTOOED GIRL BELIEVED TO BE MODEL LIN

580
00:39:47,166 --> 00:39:49,875
I don't care if you hire thugs or private investigators.

581
00:39:49,958 --> 00:39:50,875
I have her handle.

582
00:39:51,791 --> 00:39:53,458
Go find that woman for me!

583
00:39:53,541 --> 00:39:55,125
Don't call the police.

584
00:39:55,666 --> 00:39:56,541
You got that?

585
00:39:57,333 --> 00:39:58,916
You got that?

586
00:40:08,500 --> 00:40:11,541
Yeh Yueh Tong hasn't even made a move yet,

587
00:40:12,166 --> 00:40:15,791
and Ching He has already come knocking.

588
00:40:24,208 --> 00:40:25,125
Madam Fan.

589
00:40:26,958 --> 00:40:28,875
This is going to be interesting.

590
00:43:59,541 --> 00:44:02,291
Subtitle translation by: Hannah Liu
